# Root build context ignore rules.
#
# This file applies to every image built from the repository root, which today
# means Dockerfile.backend and Dockerfile.frontend. Keep it conservative:
# Dockerfile.frontend copies "frontend/" from this same context, so the
# frontend source tree must stay visible here. Only build output and
# dependency caches are dropped.
#
# IMPORTANT: data_pipeline/data/vector_db/ MUST remain in the context.
# The backend serves RAG queries straight out of that git-tracked Chroma
# store, and ensure_chroma_store() early-returns when the directory is
# present. If the vector store is missing from the image, production startup
# fails. Every exclusion under data_pipeline/data below is listed explicitly,
# one directory at a time, rather than using a wildcard plus a re-include, so
# that vector_db can never be swept up by accident.

# --- Version control and tooling metadata ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
.claude
CLAUDE.md

# --- Python virtualenvs and caches ---
backend/backend_venv
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
htmlcov
.coverage
**/.coverage

# --- Node dependencies and build output ---
**/node_modules
frontend*/dist
frontend*/.vite

# --- Local databases (production uses Neon Postgres) ---
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3-journal

# --- Experiment tracking / analysis artifacts ---
wandb
**/wandb
graphify-out
mlruns
outputs

# --- data_pipeline/data: drop every intermediate stage, KEEP vector_db ---
data_pipeline/data/raw
data_pipeline/data/parsed
data_pipeline/data/cleaned
data_pipeline/data/chunked
data_pipeline/data/validated
data_pipeline/data/bias_analysis
data_pipeline/data/chroma_db.tar.gz

# Airflow local state (never needed at serving time)
data_pipeline/airflow/logs
data_pipeline/airflow/airflow.db

# Defensive re-include: if any pattern above ever widens to match the vector
# store, this line pulls it back into the context.
!data_pipeline/data/vector_db
!data_pipeline/data/vector_db/**
